### Mapping table (declared SQLite type → HCL rendering)

| Declared type | HCL `type =` |
|---|---|
| `INT` | `int` |
| `INTEGER` | `integer` |
| `TINYINT` | `tinyint` |
| `SMALLINT` | `smallint` |
| `MEDIUMINT` | `mediumint` |
| `BIGINT` | `bigint` |
