629	```
630	
631	- Unclosed action: `--format '{{ sql '` → exit 1, stderr:
632	
633	```text
634	Error: parse log format: template: format:1: unclosed action
635	```
636	
637	- A plain literal template (`--format 'hello'`) prints `hello` with **no trailing newline**,
638	  exit 0. (The `sql`/`json`/`mermaid` functions add their own trailing newline except `json`.)
