654	## URL variants and connection errors
655	
656	All errors: exit 1, stdout empty, message on stderr as `Error: ...\n`.
657	
658	| Command | Result |
659	|---|---|
660	| `-u sqlite://t.db` (missing file) | creates 0-byte `t.db`, prints `schema "main" {\n}` |
661	| `-u sqlite://:memory:` | `schema "main" {\n}`, exit 0 |
662	| `-u sqlite://file?mode=memory` | `schema "main" {\n}`, exit 0 |
663	| `-u sqlite://` (bare) | `schema "main" {\n}`, exit 0 |
664	| `-u sqlite:///tmp/probe/rich2.db` (absolute path, 3 slashes) | works, full output |
665	| `-u "sqlite://file:memdb1?mode=memory&cache=shared"` | `Error: invalid port ":memdb1" after host` (the `file:` DSN form does not survive URL parsing) |
666	| `-u sqlite://rich2.db?_fk=1` | output identical to without `?_fk=1` |
667	| `-u sqlite://nodir/x.db` (missing dir) | `Error: sqlite: querying schemas: unable to open database file: no such file or directory` (file NOT created) |
668	| `-u sqlite://corrupt.db` (junk bytes) | `Error: sqlite: querying schemas: file is not a database` |
669	| `-u mysql://localhost:3306/db` | `Error: mysql: query system variables: dial tcp [::1]:3306: connect: connection refused` |
670	| `-u mysql://root:pass@localhost:3306/db` | same `[::1]` message |
671	| `-u mysql://` | `Error: mysql: query system variables: dial tcp 127.0.0.1:3306: connect: connection refused` |
672	| `-u postgres://localhost:5432/db` | `Error: postgres: scanning system variables: dial tcp [::1]:5432: connect: connection refused` |
673	| `-u postgres://` | `Error: postgres: scanning system variables: missing "=" after "postgres:" in connection info string"` (note the stray trailing `"` in the message) |
674	| `-u foo://bar` | `Error: sql/sqlclient: unknown driver "foo". See: https://atlasgo.io/url` |
675	
676	(The mysql/postgres dial addresses depend on how `localhost` resolves; on this host it tried
677	`[::1]` first for host-form URLs and `127.0.0.1` for the empty-host form.)
